  "notes": "Waiver filing: Exhibit A all-funds cash receipts and disbursements (10/1/22-9/30/23). The trim holds two versions of each page: the pages marked 'REVISED 1/30/24' (pp1, 3, 5, 7, 9) are used; the earlier versions (pp2, 4, 6, 8, 10) are crossed out with a red line and void. Governmental = General, Street, Cemetery, Perpetual Care, Recreation, Sales Tax (page 1); page 1a columns Surcharge, Cub creek, Water, Sewer, Solid Waste are business-type (Surcharge spending is printed on the Water line; Cub creek kept with the utility columns as in FY2024). Mixed rows split by fund type only. Balances include investments (line 3 / line 24); line 2 beginning investments blank. Gross transfers: in 55,180 (Street 50,000, Cemetery 5,025, Perpetual Care 155), out 55,180 (General 55,000 line 50; Cemetery 25 and Perpetual Care 155 line 49); Schedule of Interfund Transfers (p9) lists General->Cemetery 5,000, General->Street 50,000, Perpetual care->Cemetery 180 (total 55,180), so per-fund amounts differ from Exhibit A but totals agree. Schedule of investments (p9) total 173,561 agrees with line 27. No outstanding debt. County treasurer balances 10/1/22 1,800.00 and 9/30/23 1,823.69 are not in the totals. Detail is one line per Exhibit A fund column. Read pages 1-10 of 10."
